---
layout: layout.njk
title: Results
description: Live race results for the Buffalo Laser Class Association, updated from our results spreadsheet.
---

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h1>Race Results</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lead">
      Weekly race results for the Monday Night Series and other BLCA events. Use the filter
      to view a specific week, and click any column heading to sort.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container">
  {#
    The table is built in the browser from the published Google Sheet CSV.
    The CSV URL comes from src/_data/site.json (site.resultsCsvUrl) and is
    handed to the script below via a data- attribute, so a board member never
    has to touch JavaScript — they just paste a new URL in site.json.
  #}
  <div
    id="results-table"
    class="results"
    data-seasons='{{ site.resultsSeasons | dump | safe }}'
    data-filter-column="Date"
    data-default-sort="Date"
    data-default-dir="desc"
  >
    <p class="results__loading">Loading results&hellip;</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="/assets/js/results-table.js" defer></script>
